_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T16:20:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:20:20Z","body":"> > Very nice change. I'm happy to see someone profiling our OpenGL API usage, I'm sure there is a lot of low hanging fruit (especially for stuff like this which is rarely touched).\r\n> \r\n> Thanks! Yes, I’m focusing on WebGL optimizations since it’s the main bottleneck on web. Anything that’s not too specific to my game I'll send a PR.\r\n\r\nOne thing we have discussed in the past but haven't tackled specifically is the cost of compiling internal shaders. @jasonwinterpixel noticed a huge amount of wasted time initializing and compiling shaders that his game never used. For example, we initialize shaders related to the 3D engine even in 2D games. Have you noticed shader compilation being a bottleneck for load times in your project?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835799877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835833770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105864#issuecomment-2835833770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105864","id":2835833770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pB2Oq","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T16:33:23Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:33:23Z","body":"Yes, I’ve heavily optimized shader compilation in my project, though the code still needs cleanup and isn’t engine-ready, since it targets only the latest Chrome versions without fallbacks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835833770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835835362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105864#issuecomment-2835835362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105864","id":2835835362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pB2ni","user":{"login":"jordo","id":323868,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323868?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us